# The whole repo is LF in git and LF on disk. Without this, a Windows
# checkout with core.autocrlf=true gets CRLF working files and `pnpm
# format-check` (oxfmt) reports every one of them as misformatted, while CI on
# Linux sees LF and passes — a gate that disagrees with itself by platform.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be touched.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.woff2 binary
*.gz binary
